Z||000000||frontal lobe||11-29-2000||11:53 AM||||Deer hunting season just ended in Wisconsin and I heard the final hunt total:  438,000 deer!!!!  Yes, that is THOUSAND!!!  I think I'm the only one that didn't get one (since I don't go hunting I guess I'm not surprised.  The only deer I've ever got were road kill-3 times!)<P>Yeah, so 438,000 deer killed in the state and NO ONE COULD GET THE 3 THAT ARE EATING ALL THE PLANTS IN MY YARD!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||LarryB||11-29-2000||01:15 PM||||400,000+ kill is totally amazing to me.  The *entire herd* where I'm from (Maine) is estimated at about 300,000.<P>I can empathize with road kill. My cousin hit one with his truck on the Maine Turnpike a few weeks ago, $3000 damage and 1 dead deer.<BR>||||reg||1
