Z||000009||frontal lobe||11-30-2000||12:08 AM||||Cooter, I can't even IMAGINE what that would be like!  Glad he's ok.  Where's that camcorder when you need it?!  That is one of the reasons I'm glad they allowed so many deer permits this year.  We had several mild winters in a row and the herd was reportedly about 1.5 MILLION!  That makes for a lot of deer on the roadways.<P>I wonder if our Canadian friends have ever had run-ins with moose?  That could potentially be even worse.||||reg||1
